                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 760,
                  "content": "Brand navy and amber come straight from the SGSI company profile. Warm bone neutrals replace clinical grays, and batch statuses each own one hue so a row reads at a glance. The data-viz order is CVD-validated: navy, amber, rust, teal, violet — always in that order, always with direct labels.",
